@startuml
!pragma teoz true
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam roundCorner 15
actor Alice
actor Bob
participant Server
Alice -> Bob : hello
hnote over Alice : idle
rnote right of Bob : thinking
== Phase two ==
ref over Alice, Server : init
Bob -> Server : request
hnote over Bob, Server
  two lines
  of hexagon
end hnote
@enduml
